{"4706440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cyrurgia", "steam_appid": 4706440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/cfe538c29758bdd3870e0844bfdad829.poster.avif?t=1781816524\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/cfe538c29758bdd3870e0844bfdad829.webm?t=1781816524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/cfe538c29758bdd3870e0844bfdad829.mp4?t=1781816524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story to experience while you're having an art block... or was it 'while you're lovesick'?<br>Oh my, which one was it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-flips through pages-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where was it, where was it... I don't wanna ask again.<br>Aha, here it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a short story to experience between the end of the world and the start of the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/2eb654252c9e60d188839913c658dd37.poster.avif?t=1781816524\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/2eb654252c9e60d188839913c658dd37.mp4?t=1781816524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is taken to The Islands of the Backstage where a tragedy just took place.<br>Experience the story in the shoes of The Girl as she explores the crime scene and pieces everything together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/d1fc9d4ecd50df6471c0a688990f8625.poster.avif?t=1781816524\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/d1fc9d4ecd50df6471c0a688990f8625.webm?t=1781816524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/d1fc9d4ecd50df6471c0a688990f8625.mp4?t=1781816524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal and linear story that explores many emotions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 2-3 hours of length.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arrangement of visceral characters to talk with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brutally vanishing low-poly non-world to explore in the first-person perspective.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/c7ce0ee9ef9503e036a85a8e54e2e865.poster.avif?t=1781816524\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/c7ce0ee9ef9503e036a85a8e54e2e865.webm?t=1781816524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/c7ce0ee9ef9503e036a85a8e54e2e865.mp4?t=1781816524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will every piece be put back together when the sun rises?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Capsule Character Artwork by @doremyswt</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Trailer Soundtrack by Marron Fields Production from DOVA-SYNDROME</strong></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/cfe538c29758bdd3870e0844bfdad829.poster.avif?t=1781816524\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/cfe538c29758bdd3870e0844bfdad829.webm?t=1781816524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/cfe538c29758bdd3870e0844bfdad829.mp4?t=1781816524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story to experience while you're having an art block... or was it 'while you're lovesick'?<br>Oh my, which one was it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-flips through pages-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where was it, where was it... I don't wanna ask again.<br>Aha, here it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a short story to experience between the end of the world and the start of the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706440/extras/2eb654252c9e60d18883